     1215     + "attr-code" + chr(4) + "Код атрибута" + chr(4) + "" + chr(8)
     1216    + "gds-code" + chr(4) + "Код товара" + chr(4) + "" + chr(8)
     1217    + "PS" + chr(4) + "Примечание" + chr(4) + "" + chr(8)
     1218    + "status_" + chr(4) + "Статус" + chr(4) + ""  .
     1219    run proc-full-temp-changes in this-procedure (
